text:
 {
  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you for calling Nimbus Telecom. My name is Nisha. How can I help you today?",
      "tags": [
        "greeting"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Hi Nisha, I'm Emily Reddy. I am absolutely furious about my latest bill. I've been overcharged by forty dollars and this is the third time this has happened!",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I am very sorry to hear that you've had this experience, Ms. Reddy. I can certainly understand why you're so frustrated with these recurring charges.",
      "tags": [
        "empathy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Before we dive into the account details, could you please provide me with your account number?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "It is 77264814. My phone number is 94145 70548 and my email is emily.85@examplemail.com.",
      "tags": [
        "identity_verification"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Thank you for that information. Let me take a look at your billing history. One moment please.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "I just don't see why I have to keep calling in. If this isn't fixed now, I'm just going to cancel my service and switch to another provider.",
      "tags": [
        "churn_signal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "I completely understand. Looking at the bill, I see the error. There is a duplicate charge for the premium data package. I will raise a refund request for the wrong charge right now.",
      "tags": [
        "action:refund_request"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "Please keep in mind that this credit is subject to approval by our billing department and typically takes 7-10 business days to appear on your statement.",
      "tags": [
        "disclosure"
      ]
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "Okay, as long as it gets sorted. I appreciate you actually finding the mistake quickly.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "You're very welcome. Is there anything else I can assist you with today?",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "customer",
      "text": "No, that's all I needed. Thank you for your help, Nisha.",
      "tags": []
    },
    {
      "speaker": "agent",
      "text": "It was my pleasure. To summarize, I've submitted the refund request for the duplicate charge. Thank you for choosing Nimbus Telecom. Goodbye!",
      "tags": [
        "closure"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
